DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19609::$$$message_0154_0000_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19610::$$$message_0154_0000_0001$$$::I'm alone. I'll check out my guestroom.[lr]::
19611::$$$message_0154_0000_0002$$$::It wouldn't be too bad if I was [font italic=true]only[font italic=false] locked in here... But I know Sella wouldn't be satisfied with that.::
19612::$$$message_0154_0001_0000$$$::"...No traps, I hope."[lr]::
19613::$$$message_0154_0001_0001$$$::Like a ceiling drop trap, floor spikes, [wait canskip=0 time=400][dash textoff=0 mx=0 opacity=200 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=762 imag=1.7 time=8000 cy=582 mag=1.7 my=-272 storage=iアインツ監禁部屋(寝袋b)-(深夜) rot=-0.0 accel=0]walls that close in, or water that floods the room...[lr]::
19614::$$$message_0154_0001_0002$$$::"...Okay. I'm safe."[lr]::
19615::$$$message_0154_0001_0003$$$::I reassure myself after examining every square centimeter of the room.::
19616::$$$message_0154_0002_0000$$$::"Looks like Sella isn't [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] evil.[lr]::
19617::$$$message_0154_0002_0001$$$::...Good. I'm tired, so I'll..."[lr]::
19618::$$$message_0154_0002_0002$$$::Go to sleep.[lr]::
19619::$$$message_0154_0002_0003$$$::Humans can sleep when they desperately want to.::
19620::$$$message_0154_0003_0000$$$::"Shirou? Are you in here?"[lr]::
19621::$$$message_0154_0003_0001$$$::"Illya...?"[lr]::
19622::$$$message_0154_0003_0002$$$::I get up to greet my sudden guest.[lr]::
19623::$$$message_0154_0003_0003$$$::Illya opens the door and comes in.[lr]::
19624::$$$message_0154_0003_0004$$$::She takes one look at the room.::
19625::$$$message_0154_0004_0000$$$::"What are you doing in a storage room?[lr]::
19626::$$$message_0154_0004_0001$$$::Do you feel comfortable sleeping in places like sheds and warehouses?"::
19627::$$$message_0154_0005_0000$$$::"No. This is my bedroom."[lr]::
19628::$$$message_0154_0005_0001$$$::I desperately bite back a yawn.[lr]::
19629::$$$message_0154_0005_0002$$$::"......"[lr]::
19630::$$$message_0154_0005_0003$$$::Ooh, she looks shocked.::
19631::$$$message_0154_0006_0000$$$::"There are so many guestrooms downstairs.[lr]::
19632::$$$message_0154_0006_0001$$$::Did you choose this room because you were trying not to impose on us?"[lr]::
19633::$$$message_0154_0006_0002$$$::"No. Sella said, 'this is your room, Master Emiya,' and didn't give me a choice."::
19634::$$$message_0154_0007_0000$$$::"Eh? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ08g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ08g(中)]...Oh, what is she thinking!?[lr]::
19635::$$$message_0154_0007_0001$$$::How could she make you sleep in a storage room!?"::
19636::$$$message_0154_0008_0000$$$::"I know, right? There's a bed, though. That's probably a concession on her part."[lr]::
19637::$$$message_0154_0008_0001$$$::I can just imagine her saying, "you mustn't, Mistress. Only a doghouse is fit for a starved mutt who might bite your hand at any moment. But since we do not even have such proper lodging, I offered this bare room," hahaha.::
19638::$$$message_0154_0009_0000$$$::"Ugh, this is so embarrassing.[lr]::
19639::$$$message_0154_0009_0001$$$::...Shirou, don't sleep here."[lr]::
19640::$$$message_0154_0009_0002$$$::Illya grabs my hand and pulls me along in righteous indignation.[lr]::
19641::$$$message_0154_0009_0003$$$::But...::
19642::$$$message_0154_0010_0000$$$::"You mustn't, Mistress."[lr]::
19643::$$$message_0154_0010_0001$$$::The shady maid appears without a sound.[lr]::
19644::$$$message_0154_0010_0002$$$::I wonder if the maids can pop out of thin air at will anywhere in the castle.[lr]::
19645::$$$message_0154_0010_0003$$$::Just because she's wearing white doesn't mean she isn't shady.::
19646::$$$message_0154_0011_0000$$$::"Sella!"[lr]::
19647::$$$message_0154_0011_0001$$$::"Your kindness is wasted on this commoner of unknown lineage. I initially planned to put him in a doghouse, but I even went to the trouble of furnishing this storage room with a sleeping bag.[lr]::
19648::$$$message_0154_0011_0002$$$::I believe that is more than enough Einzbern hospitality for him already."[lr]::
19649::$$$message_0154_0011_0003$$$::"...Heh."[lr]::
19650::$$$message_0154_0011_0004$$$::Aw, shucks. My powers of prediction are so good they're making me sad.::
19651::$$$message_0154_0012_0000$$$::"Sella. Prepare a guestroom downstairs at once."[lr]::
19652::$$$message_0154_0012_0001$$$::"Mistress[line len=2]"[lr]::
19653::$$$message_0154_0012_0002$$$::"I will not allow Shirou to sleep in a place like this. He is my guest."[lr]::
19654::$$$message_0154_0012_0003$$$::"But our patriarch has forbidden outsiders from staying in this[line len=2]"::
19655::$$$message_0154_0013_0000$$$::Oh no. Sella and Illya are getting into an argument.[lr]::
19656::$$$message_0154_0013_0001$$$::"Uh, guys?"[lr]::
19657::$$$message_0154_0013_0002$$$::I clear my throat to get their attention.::
19658::$$$message_0154_0014_0000$$$::"I'm okay with this."[lr]::
19659::$$$message_0154_0014_0001$$$::"Shirou?"[lr]::
19660::$$$message_0154_0014_0002$$$::"There's a roof over my head, a window, and the sleeping bag doesn't have any holes in it. It's good enough for a single night. I'd say it's a far sight better than sleeping in the forest ruins."::
19661::$$$message_0154_0015_0000$$$::"...I am impressed by your discerning eye, Master Emiya."[lr]::
19662::$$$message_0154_0015_0001$$$::Sella nods gracefully.[lr]::
19663::$$$message_0154_0015_0002$$$::...I can't tell if she's being sarcastic or not.::
19664::$$$message_0154_0016_0000$$$::"So I'll sleep here tonight. You served me a fancy dinner, so I won't complain."[lr]::
19665::$$$message_0154_0016_0001$$$::"Really, Shirou...?"[lr]::
19666::$$$message_0154_0016_0002$$$::"Your understanding is a relief, Master Emiya.[lr]::
19667::$$$message_0154_0016_0003$$$::Mistress, it is time to douse the lights. Let us return to your chambers."::
19668::$$$message_0154_0017_0000$$$::"Yeah. See ya, Illya."[lr]::
19669::$$$message_0154_0017_0001$$$::"Okay. Bye."[lr]::
19670::$$$message_0154_0017_0002$$$::...She doesn't say good night.[lr]::
19671::$$$message_0154_0017_0003$$$::This room does feel too desolate to be a bedroom.[lr]::
19672::$$$message_0154_0017_0004$$$::But that won't bother me once I'm asleep.::
19673::$$$message_0154_0018_0000$$$::".........Hm?"[lr]::
19674::$$$message_0154_0018_0001$$$::I hear the door's hinges creaking.[lr]::
19675::$$$message_0154_0018_0002$$$::Just as I'm nearly asleep, I realize that someone else is in the room.::
19676::$$$message_0154_0019_0000$$$::"Big Brother...are you still awake?"[lr]::
19677::$$$message_0154_0019_0001$$$::"Illya?"[lr]::
19678::$$$message_0154_0019_0002$$$::Did she come here all by herself this late at night?::
19679::$$$message_0154_0020_0000$$$::"Yeah, I'm awake. Are you here because of what happened earlier...?"[lr]::
19680::$$$message_0154_0020_0001$$$::"Yeah. Sella won't be around now.[lr]::
19681::$$$message_0154_0020_0002$$$::I know you meant well for me, but I really don't want to let you sleep in a place like this."::
19682::$$$message_0154_0021_0000$$$::"...Illya."[lr]::
19683::$$$message_0154_0021_0001$$$::So that's why she came here alone after lights are out in the castle.[lr]::
19684::$$$message_0154_0021_0002$$$::It'd be rude of me to turn down her kindness.::
19685::$$$message_0154_0022_0000$$$::"Yeah... I feel like an idiot. I should've taken up your offer right away.[lr]::
19686::$$$message_0154_0022_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ08d(中)]So, where should I go now?"[lr]::
19687::$$$message_0154_0022_0002$$$::"You don't have to move far. Let's sleep together in my room."[lr]::
19688::$$$message_0154_0022_0003$$$::Oh, Illya's room. That doesn't sound so[line len=2]::
19689::$$$message_0154_0023_0000$$$::Wait, [quake vmax=20 hmax=0 time=800]what!?[lr]::
19690::$$$message_0154_0023_0001$$$::Sleeping together in her room!?[lr]::
19691::$$$message_0154_0023_0002$$$::No way. Illya's like a little sister to me. No, wait. There isn't anything weird about that. But no, she's still a lady even if she's small, so being in the same bed would be problematic. In fact, it would be nothing but a problem[line len=2]::
19692::$$$message_0154_0024_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19693::$$$message_0154_0024_0001$$$::"What's the matter, Shirou? You look restless."[lr]::
19694::$$$message_0154_0024_0002$$$::Nothing's wrong, and yet a feeling that something's [font italic=true]very[font italic=false] wrong with this is plaguing me.[lr]::
19695::$$$message_0154_0024_0003$$$::I can't answer yes or no.::
19696::$$$message_0154_0025_0000$$$::"Mrgh... Are you that against sleeping in my room? Because I held you captive there before?"[lr]::
19697::$$$message_0154_0025_0001$$$::"No, that doesn't have anything to do with it..."[lr]::
19698::$$$message_0154_0025_0002$$$::"Hmph. If you won't come to my room, then I'll just have to sleep here."::
19699::$$$message_0154_0026_0000$$$::Illya throws herself onto the cheap mattress.[lr]::
19700::$$$message_0154_0026_0001$$$::...My mind's made up. I can't let Illya sleep in a place like this.::
19701::$$$message_0154_0027_0000$$$::"...All right. Can I take you up on your offer, then?"[lr]::
19702::$$$message_0154_0027_0001$$$::"Of course![lr]::
19703::$$$message_0154_0027_0002$$$::Yay, we'll be together all night, Shirou!"[lr]::
19704::$$$message_0154_0027_0003$$$::Illya's ecstatic.[lr]::
19705::$$$message_0154_0027_0004$$$::Surely this can't be the wrong choice, if it makes her this happy...right?::
19706::$$$message_0154_0028_0000$$$::Her bedroom is incomparably luxurious compared to my solitary confinement cell[line len=2]I mean, my improvised guestroom.[lr]::
19707::$$$message_0154_0028_0001$$$::It should be more comfortable to sleep here with Illya than in that room by myself...or so I thought.::
19708::$$$message_0154_0029_0000$$$::"Turn that way, Shirou."[lr]::
19709::$$$message_0154_0029_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
19710::$$$message_0154_0029_0002$$$::"I can't sleep in these clothes, can I?[lr]::
19711::$$$message_0154_0029_0003$$$::I need to change, so..."[lr]::
19712::$$$message_0154_0029_0004$$$::Ahh, right. Not like me.::
19713::$$$message_0154_0030_0000$$$::"...Hmm?"[lr]::
19714::$$$message_0154_0030_0001$$$::"What's up, Illya?"[lr]::
19715::$$$message_0154_0030_0002$$$::"Do you want to see me change? I don't mind letting you look."[lr]::
19716::$$$message_0154_0030_0003$$$::Don't say anything stupid.[lr]::
19717::$$$message_0154_0030_0004$$$::It might not matter at Illya's age, but men and women should observe some modicum of modesty.::
19718::$$$message_0154_0031_0000$$$::"Yeah yeah. You are no fun to tease about these things. Face that way then."[lr]::
19719::$$$message_0154_0031_0001$$$::I do as I'm told.[lr]::
19720::$$$message_0154_0031_0002$$$::...I'll admit I feel slightly let down.::
19721::$$$message_0154_0032_0000$$$::Silence falls on the room.[lr]::
19722::$$$message_0154_0032_0001$$$::I hear the rustling of fabric.[lr]::
19723::$$$message_0154_0032_0002$$$::I can feel Illya slipping into bed behind me.[lr]::
19724::$$$message_0154_0032_0003$$$::"It's okay now."::
19725::$$$message_0154_0033_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19726::$$$message_0154_0033_0001$$$::I'm next to Illya in bed.[lr]::
19727::$$$message_0154_0033_0002$$$::There's plenty of room for the both of us.::
19728::$$$message_0154_0034_0000$$$::"...Hey. Can I get closer?"[lr]::
19729::$$$message_0154_0034_0001$$$::"Sure. It's actually so big that a breeze will get inside unless we're closer together. I wouldn't be able to face Sella and Leys if I let you catch a cold."[lr]::
19730::$$$message_0154_0034_0002$$$::"R-right... Okay. Don't mind if I do."[lr]::
19731::$$$message_0154_0034_0003$$$::She snuggles up against me.::
19732::$$$message_0154_0035_0000$$$::"...Ehehe."[lr]::
19733::$$$message_0154_0035_0001$$$::Her voice sounds more happy than shy.[lr]::
19734::$$$message_0154_0035_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
19735::$$$message_0154_0035_0003$$$::I'm glad I'm here now.[lr]::
19736::$$$message_0154_0035_0004$$$::A small child shouldn't be sleeping all alone in this big, cold bed.::
19737::$$$message_0154_0036_0000$$$::"Mm... Your body feels a little hot, Shirou. Like a hot water bottle."[lr]::
19738::$$$message_0154_0036_0001$$$::"A hot water bottle? I'm surprised you know about those. They're pretty old these days."[lr]::
19739::$$$message_0154_0036_0002$$$::"Yeah. Kiritsugu told Mother about them when we were at home.[lr]::
19740::$$$message_0154_0036_0003$$$::He said that it was colder than he expected, and that he missed hot water bottles. I think I'm starting to understand what he meant."::
19741::$$$message_0154_0037_0000$$$::Illya nuzzles her cheek against my chest.[lr]::
19742::$$$message_0154_0037_0001$$$::I'm being hugged like a big stuffed animal. Speaking of which, there's a lot of them in here.::
19743::$$$message_0154_0038_0000$$$::"...Do you normally sleep with stuffed animals?"[lr]::
19744::$$$message_0154_0038_0001$$$::"Like Bonifacius and Otto? Yeah, sometimes."[lr]::
19745::$$$message_0154_0038_0002$$$::Her stuffed animals have imposing names, as always.[lr]::
19746::$$$message_0154_0038_0003$$$::The mental image of Illya in her pajamas sleeping with the stuffed animals is adorable, yet somehow sad.::
19747::$$$message_0154_0039_0000$$$::"Oh, this is your first time seeing my pajamas, isn't it?[lr]::
19748::$$$message_0154_0039_0001$$$::What do you think?"[lr]::
19749::$$$message_0154_0039_0002$$$::I ruffle Illya's hair.[lr]::
19750::$$$message_0154_0039_0003$$$::Her hair is thin and smooth, like silk. When I pet her small head, she happily snuggles up to me.::
19751::$$$message_0154_0040_0000$$$::"It's cute. You look like a fairy-tale princess."[lr]::
19752::$$$message_0154_0040_0001$$$::"Eheh. No one's ever said that to me before... Mm."[lr]::
19753::$$$message_0154_0040_0002$$$::My body heat is starting to warm Illya.[lr]::
19754::$$$message_0154_0040_0003$$$::That should make it easier for her to sleep.::
19755::$$$message_0154_0041_0000$$$::"Big Brother?"[lr]::
19756::$$$message_0154_0041_0001$$$::"Mm... What?"[lr]::
19757::$$$message_0154_0041_0002$$$::"Did you ever sleep with anyone when you were little?"[lr]::
19758::$$$message_0154_0041_0003$$$::I don't have any memories of that. Back then, Kiritsugu was always traveling and never home, and Fuji-nee didn't sleep over.::
19759::$$$message_0154_0042_0000$$$::"What about you, Illya? Did you sleep with your mom?"[lr]::
19760::$$$message_0154_0042_0001$$$::I respond casually.[lr]::
19761::$$$message_0154_0042_0002$$$::Suddenly, she squeezes my chest tightly.[lr]::
19762::$$$message_0154_0042_0003$$$::I feel Illya stiffen. I stroke her back to comfort her.::
19763::$$$message_0154_0043_0000$$$::"...Sorry. I shouldn't have asked. I'm just nervous because I've never slept in the same bed with anyone."[lr]::
19764::$$$message_0154_0043_0001$$$::"Mm...mm, [fadein textoff=0 time=400 storage=fd22]hehehehe."[lr]::
19765::$$$message_0154_0043_0002$$$::Finally, Illya starts to relax again.[lr]::
19766::$$$message_0154_0043_0003$$$::I feel her delicate warmth and her quiet breaths.::
19767::$$$message_0154_0044_0000$$$::"It's always been cold, sleeping by myself. Now that you're here, I feel so warm and comfortable..."[lr]::
19768::$$$message_0154_0044_0001$$$::Illya yawns.[lr]::
19769::$$$message_0154_0044_0002$$$::"I know this is just a dream.[lr]::
19770::$$$message_0154_0044_0003$$$::I wonder if I would've been happier if I'd slept with you every night."::
19771::$$$message_0154_0045_0000$$$::Her words are half sincere, half sleep-addled.[lr]::
19772::$$$message_0154_0045_0001$$$::It sounds like she's talking to someone who isn't here. She must be half-asleep already.::
19773::$$$message_0154_0046_0000$$$::"...I see. But I don't think you'd want to.[lr]::
19774::$$$message_0154_0046_0001$$$::I might toss and turn while I'm asleep. I think you'd get fed up with me."[lr]::
19775::$$$message_0154_0046_0002$$$::"I know. But there's plenty of ways to fix that."::
19776::$$$message_0154_0047_0000$$$::She clings to me.[lr]::
19777::$$$message_0154_0047_0001$$$::I feel warm, and my eyelids are getting heavy.[lr]::
19778::$$$message_0154_0047_0002$$$::Our sleepy conversation feels distant, like someone else is having it.::
19779::$$$message_0154_0048_0000$$$::"...Hehe. You're hopeless without me, Shirou."[lr]::
19780::$$$message_0154_0048_0001$$$::Her dreamlike words tickle me.[lr]::
19781::$$$message_0154_0048_0002$$$::Illya is as soft and warm as a kitten.::
19782::$$$message_0154_0049_0000$$$::"Huah... We should sleep, Illya."[lr]::
19783::$$$message_0154_0049_0001$$$::"Yeah. Your everyday life is going to keep going for a while longer.[lr]::
19784::$$$message_0154_0049_0002$$$::Well...see you tomorrow, Big Brother."::
19785::$$$message_0154_0050_0000$$$::...Her satisfied voice lulls me to sleep.[lr]::
19786::$$$message_0154_0050_0001$$$::Feeling Illya's warmth, I drift off into fleeting, blissful dreams.::
19787::$$$message_0154_0051_0000$$$::The fourth night wears on.[lr]::
19788::$$$message_0154_0051_0001$$$::I'm gently immersed in tears of joy.[lr]::
19789::$$$message_0154_0051_0002$$$::Among the many endings I've encountered, tonight's slumber is an innocent, cloudless paradise.[lr]::
19790::$$$message_0154_0051_0003$$$::...That's what makes it a little poignant.[lr]::
19791::$$$message_0154_0051_0004$$$::The more perfect it is,[lr]::
19792::$$$message_0154_0051_0005$$$::the greater the loss once I wake up and start yet another beginning.::
919726::$$$message_9154_0033_0001$$$::I'm next to Illya in bed.[r]::z